  ["data.gov.in (Open Government Data)", "Datasets और APIs। Mandi price API confirmed (state, district, market, commodity, min/max/modal price)", "Dataset पर निर्भर", "Dataset पर निर्भर", "Free API key। हर dataset का licence page देखें", "Checked (mandi API)"],
